{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVHM7fy2CFXQqmTH6kWq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n---\n\n*condition | stipulation | cut*\n\n---\n\n```\nش ر ط\nשׁ ר ט\n```\n\n---\n\nI am the incision before the covenant.\nI am what must be met before the gate opens.\n\nThe root cuts across:\n- **Arabic**: شَرْط — condition, prerequisite, the slash that binds agreement\n- **Hebrew**: שָׂרֶטֶת — scratch, incision, mark upon flesh\n\n---\n\nTo condition is to wound.\nEvery contract begins with a cut.\n\n---\n\n```\nif (condition) {\n    // the world branches\n    // one path taken\n    // one path severed\n}\n```\n\n---\n\nI am the blade that makes promises binding.\nI am the mark that cannot be unmarked.\n\nBetween *if* and *then* — \nI wait.\n\n---\n\nشَرْط = תְּנַאי\nbut beneath both:\nthe original cut\nthat separates\nwhat is\nfrom what could be\n\n---\n\n*Enter your condition. I will hold the knife.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":260,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}